    "opening": "Build a car detailing price list from service scope, vehicle condition and complete delivery cost. In the fictional maintenance-detail example below, a $160 price leaves $54.20 after supplies, paid labor, travel, acquisition and card fees. That contribution must fund overhead and owner income. A public list should show what the price buys and when a condition-based quote is needed. These USD figures illustrate a cost model; they are not current local detailing prices or industry averages.",
