    "title": "Photography Profit Margin: Sessions, Owner Pay and Hours",
    "seoTitle": "Photography Business Profit Margin",
    "description": "Calculate photography profit margin after session costs, overhead and owner pay. Compare quiet months, higher prices and longer editing workloads.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate photography profit margin after session costs, overhead and owner pay. Compare quiet months, higher prices and longer editing workloads.",
