    "seoTitle": "Ecommerce Profit Margin: Orders to Overhead",
    "description": "Learn ecommerce profit margins after product, shipping, ads, returns, payment, marketplace, overhead, and owner-pay costs with worked examples.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate ecommerce contribution and operating profit from net sales, fees, returns and overhead. Reconcile a monthly example before judging your margin.",
    "image": "/images/blog/day3-ecommerce-margin.webp",
